// Wave 2: large parallel-sourced expansion following the "think 1000"
// target. 10 research agents covered ~189 cities across every region;
// after centralized re-verification (license/sourceUrl re-derivation,
// visual spot-checks, and — for the South Asia and Middle East
// batches specifically — finishing the download+inspection pipeline
// myself after Wikimedia rate-limiting interrupted the agents) this
// script adds the items that passed every gate. See CURATION_NOTES.md
// for the full funnel record, including what was dropped and why
// (Lusaka: 2008 photo, not historical; Sana'a: unresolved authenticity
// concern; Doha, Mosul: no clean candidate; 12 South Asia candidates:
// held for a future pass after repeated rate-limiting).
//
// Run once, from the repo root: node scripts/migrate-build-seed-items-wave2.js
